sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Moviegoer
    participant TicketingWeb as Movie Ticketing Web App
    participant TicketingAPI as Movie Ticketing API
    participant TicketingDB as Ticketing Database
    participant PaymentGateway as Payment Gateway
    participant EmailService as Email Service
    Moviegoer->>TicketingWeb: Select seats on seat map
    TicketingWeb->>TicketingAPI: POST /api/v1/shows/{showId}/holds (JWT)
    TicketingAPI->>TicketingDB: Insert SeatHold in transaction
    TicketingDB-->>TicketingAPI: holdId and expiresUtc
    TicketingAPI-->>TicketingWeb: HTTP 201 hold created
    TicketingWeb->>TicketingAPI: POST /api/v1/orders/quote (holdId)
    TicketingAPI-->>TicketingWeb: Price breakdown with grand total
    TicketingWeb->>TicketingAPI: POST /api/v1/payments/intent
    TicketingAPI->>PaymentGateway: Create payment intent
    PaymentGateway-->>TicketingWeb: Hosted payment fields
    Moviegoer->>PaymentGateway: Submit card details
    PaymentGateway-->>TicketingAPI: Signed webhook payment succeeded
    TicketingAPI->>TicketingDB: Confirm Booking, mark seats booked, hold Converted
    TicketingAPI->>EmailService: Dispatch QR e-ticket
    TicketingAPI-->>TicketingWeb: Booking reference and QR ticket
    TicketingWeb-->>Moviegoer: Confirmation page with e-ticket